business_id":"P3Oy6-nfqP46PmHJXNPLYA","review_id":"9JK74SnwpfHdlHz0dcpfaw","date":"2019-03-31T18:22:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9520423412322998,"text_excerpt":"This use to be old village coffee. I love that Starbucks took this place over. It's always so busy! The staff here is extremely friendly and always working hard. I come here about 2-3 times a week. There's an upstairs area that I see students study all the time so this place is constantly full. I'm happy to see that it's doing well. You pretty much have to find street parking because their lot is always full (6-7 cars). There's plenty!"},{"business_id":"P3Oy6-nfqP46PmHJXNPLYA","review_id":"fst9N8JY78Qa4dSm3QjxaQ","date":"2018-06-15T16:47:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9391629695892334,"text_excerpt":"This is my go-to Starbucks in the city. I come here A LOT and I wouldn't keep coming back if I didn't think the service and drinks were spot on. Whether I'm just running in for a quick pick-me-up or I'm coming to hunker down for a few hours and study upstairs, it's always a great experience. It's also nice when you're on a first name basis with one of the employees. :) Anyway, everything I order comes out relatively fast and tastes great and I love the decor/ambience (and the fact that there's an upstairs). I love this Starbucks!"},{"business_id":"P3Oy6-nfqP46PmHJXNPLYA","review_id":"GYWibg4GI62nlabam1Z5ug","date":"2018-05-24T21:43:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9353857040405273,"text_excerpt":"The most important thing to know about this Starbucks is that it's super busy in the morning and the best thing to do is place a mobile order. They are friendly enough and I do love the outdoor seating. Parking can be a bit rough but I've never had to walk more than a block and a half."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"P3Oy6-nfqP46PmHJXNPLYA","photo_id":"EJoJcZFOGY5lZcvTMiMq0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EJoJcZFOGY5lZcvTMiMq0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8994655609130859},{